       <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n          <span style=\"flex:1\">旧：A @ → 76.223.54.1</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">已停用</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">↓ 修改记录值</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px\">\n          <span style=\"flex:1\">新：A @ → 76.223.105.8</span><span class=\"demo-tag green\">生效中</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:12px;background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">\n        在旧记录缓存结束前，部分用户仍可能访问旧服务器；确认流量完成迁移后再关闭旧服务\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;flex:1\">DNS resolution · vibeui.dev</b>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">＋Add record</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:6px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:64px\">Type</span><span style=\"width:56px\">Host Record</span><span style=\"flex:1\">Record Value</span><span style=\"width:48px\">TTL</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:64px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">A</span></span><span style=\"width:56px;font-size:12px\">@</span><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;font-family:monospace\">76.223.54.1</span><span style=\"width:48px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">600</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:64px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">CNAME</span></span><span style=\"width:56px;font-size:12px\">www</span><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;font-family:monospace\">vibeui.dev</span><span style=\"width:48px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">600</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 2px\">\n        <span style=\"width:64px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">CNAME</span></span><span style=\"width:56px;font-size:12px\">blog</span><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;font-family:monospace\">vibeui.dev</span><span style=\"width:48px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">600</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n      <div style=\"color:#a6d189\">$ dig vibeui.dev</div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">;; QUESTION SECTION:</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">;vibeui.dev.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IN&nbsp;&nbsp;A</div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">;; ANSWER SECTION:</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">vibeui.dev.&nbsp;&nbsp;600&nbsp;&nbsp;IN&nbsp;&nbsp;A&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">76.223.54.1</span></div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">;; Query time: 23 msec</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px\">Modify parsing record</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <span style=\"width:56px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Type</span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">A</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <span style=\"width:56px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Record value</span>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;font-family:monospace\" value=\"76.223.105.8\">\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px\">\n        <span style=\"width:56px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">TTL</span>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:80px\" value=\"600\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Seconds; smaller TTL facilitates switching, but does not clear existing cache</span>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%\">Save, it will take effect in about 10 minutes</button>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">Migrate to a new server</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n          <span style=\"flex:1\">Old: A @ → 76.223.54.1</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">Deactivated</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">↓ Modify record value</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px\">\n          <span style=\"flex:1\">New: A @ → 76.223.105.8</span><span class=\"demo-tag green\">Effective</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:12px;background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">\n        Before the end of the old record caching, some users may still access the old server; confirm that the traffic has been migrated before closing the old service.\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"dns-anat\"><span class=\"ap dns-node\" data-ap=\"client\"><span class=\"dns-ico\">🌐</span><span class=\"dns-name\">浏览器</span></span><span class=\"dns-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"ap dns-node\" data-ap=\"book\"><span class=\"dns-ico\">📒</span><span class=\"dns-name\">DNS 服务器</span></span><span class=\"dns-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"ap dns-a\" data-ap=\"record\">A 记录<br>vibeui.dev → IP</span><span class=\"dns-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"ap dns-a\" data-ap=\"ip\" style=\"color:var(--green);background:var(--green-light)\">76.223.54.1</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"dns-anat\"><span class=\"ap dns-node\" data-ap=\"client\"><span class=\"dns-ico\">🌐</span><span class=\"dns-name\">Browser</span></span><span class=\"dns-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"ap dns-node\" data-ap=\"book\"><span class=\"dns-ico\">📒</span><span class=\"dns-name\">DNS Server</span></span><span class=\"dns-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"ap dns-a\" data-ap=\"record\">A record<br>vibeui.dev → IP</span><span class=\"dns-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"ap dns-a\" data-ap=\"ip\" style=\"color:var(--green);background:var(--green-light)\">76.223.54.1</span></span>","parts":[{"key":"client","cn":"递归解析器","en":"Resolver","desc":"浏览器通常把查询交给递归解析器；它会查缓存，必要时向权威 DNS 查询","desc_en":"The browser usually hands off the query to a recursive resolver; it checks the cache and, if necessary, queries the authoritative DNS"},{"key":"book","cn":"权威 DNS","en":"Authoritative DNS","desc":"为域名保存正式记录的服务器；递归解析器从这里取得可缓存的答案","desc_en":"Server that keeps official records for domain names; recursive resolvers get cacheable answers from here"},{"key":"record","cn":"解析记录","en":"Record","desc":"你在控制台登记的那一行：A 记 IP，CNAME 记另一个域名","desc_en":"The line you registered in the console: A records the IP, CNAME records another domain name"},{"key":"ip","cn":"IP 地址","en":"IP Address","desc":"查到的门牌号，浏览器拿它去敲服务器的门","desc_en":"The found house number is used by the browser to knock on the server's door."}]},"variants":[{"cn":"A 记录","en":"A Record","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">A</span> @ → 76.223.54.1</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">A</span> @ → 76.223.54.1</span>","when":"域名指向 IPv4 地址，最常用","when_en":"Domain names point to IPv4 addresses, most commonly used"},{"cn":"CNAME","en":"CNAME","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">CNAME</span> www → vibeui.dev</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">CNAME</span> www → vibeui.dev</span>","when":"域名指向另一个域名，托管常用","when_en":"The domain name points to another domain name, commonly used in hosting"},{"cn":"AAAA","en":"AAAA","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">AAAA</span> @ → 2606:…:1</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">AAAA</span> @ → 2606:…:1</span>","when":"域名指向 IPv6 地址","when_en":"Domain name points to IPv6 address"},{"cn":"TXT","en":"TXT","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">TXT</span> @ → \"verify=8f2k…\"</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">TXT</span> @ → \"verify=8f2k…\"</span>","when":"验证域名所有权、配置邮箱时用","when_en":"Used when verifying domain name ownership and configuring email addresses"}],"use":[{"t":"需要把名称指向 IPv4 地址时配置 <b>A 记录</b>","m":"dns-arecord"},{"t":"需要把一个名称指向另一个域名时配置 <b>CNAME</b>","m":"dns-cname"},{"t":"改完解析先看<b>TTL 与现有缓存</b>，再从外部递归解析器复查；不同地点看到新记录的时间可能不同","m":"dns-ttl"},{"t":"网站无法访问时，先用 dig、nslookup 或在线工具<b>核对外部解析结果</b>","m":"dns-check"}],"dont":[{"t":"同一个名称配置 <b>CNAME 和其他数据记录</b>：标准 DNS 中 CNAME 不能与其他记录并存；托管商的 ALIAS/扁平化规则另看文档","m":"dns-conflict","bad":true},{"t":"旧缓存尚未到期时<b>反复修改记录</b>，不同解析器可能看到多套结果，会增加排查难度","m":"dns-impatient","bad":true},{"t":"计划切换服务前<b>没有提前调整 TTL 并等待旧缓存过期</b>：原记录可能继续被使用；稳定记录使用较长 TTL 本身并非错误","m":"dns-ttl-long","bad":true},{"t":"<b>记录值填写错误</b>：请求可能到达错误服务或无法访问，应复制核对并从外部复查","m":"dns-typo","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"域名刚改到新服务器，有些人看到新站，有些人仍打开旧站。下一步怎样排查更稳妥？","options":[{"id":"repeat-edits","label":"每隔几分钟更换一次记录值，直到所有人看到新站","feedback":"旧缓存尚未过期时反复修改会产生更多版本，让不同地点的结果更难判断。","correct":false},{"id":"verify-and-wait","label":"核对当前记录和外部解析结果，再结合 TTL 等待缓存更新","feedback":"先确认新记录本身正确，再区分配置错误与旧缓存未过期，能避免无意义的连续修改。","correct":true},{"id":"clear-one-browser","label":"只清理自己的浏览器缓存，并据此判断全球已经更新","feedback":"浏览器缓存只是其中一层；其他地区的递归解析器仍可能保留旧记录，单点结果不能代表全部。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A domain was just pointed to a new server. Some people see the new site while others still see the old one. What is the safest next check?","options":[{"id":"repeat-edits","label":"Change the record value every few minutes until everyone sees the new site","feedback":"Repeated edits while old caches remain create more versions and make regional results harder to diagnose.","correct":false},{"id":"verify-and-wait","label":"Verify the current record and external lookup results, then account for TTL caching","feedback":"Confirming the new record first separates a configuration error from an old cached answer and avoids unnecessary changes.","correct":true},{"id":"clear-one-browser","label":"Clear one browser cache and use that result to declare the global update complete","feedback":"Browser cache is only one layer. Recursive resolvers elsewhere may still hold the previous record.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"域名切换服务器后各地结果不一致。请先核对当前 DNS 记录和 TTL，再用外部解析结果区分配置错误与旧缓存。不要反复改值。告诉我需要等待什么、怎样确认新记录已经稳定生效。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Results differ by location after moving the domain to a new server. Verify the current DNS record and TTL, then use external lookups to distinguish an error from old cache. Do not keep editing values. Explain what to wait for and how to confirm stable propagation."}},"references":[{"title":"DNS 词汇表","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/DNS","title_en":"DNS"}],"scenes":["DNS 控制台加记录","终端 dig 查解析","修改解析等生效","换服务器改指向"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Point a domain to a website","m":"dns-arecord"},{"t":"Configure a subdomain","m":"dns-cname"},{"t":"Connect email service","m":"dns-ttl"},{"t":"Verify domain ownership","m":"dns-check"}],"dont":[{"t":"Delete existing records without checking their purpose","m":"dns-conflict","bad":true},{"t":"Expect every resolver to update immediately","m":"dns-impatient","bad":true},{"t":"Mix up the record name and destination","m":"dns-ttl-long","bad":true},{"t":"Publish private server credentials as DNS values","m":"dns-typo","bad":true}],"scenes":["Website launch","Subdomain setup","Email records","Ownership verification"],"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;flex:1\">DNS resolution · vibeui.dev</b>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">＋Add record</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:6px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:64px\">Type</span><span style=\"width:56px\">Host Record</span><span style=\"flex:1\">Record Value</span><span style=\"width:48px\">TTL</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:64px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">A</span></span><span style=\"width:56px;font-size:12px\">@</span><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;font-family:monospace\">76.223.54.1</span><span style=\"width:48px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">600</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:64px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">CNAME</span></span><span style=\"width:56px;font-size:12px\">www</span><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;font-family:monospace\">vibeui.dev</span><span style=\"width:48px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">600</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"disp